WEBVTT

01:53.200 --> 01:53.759
Father.

02:05.480 --> 02:06.350
Father.

04:30.790 --> 04:31.600
Ms. Pei,

04:32.110 --> 04:34.440
you were also a member of the Chongwu Camp.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.840
Why are you fighting against me?

04:37.430 --> 04:39.630
People of different aspirations can't get along.

04:39.630 --> 04:41.290
Since you want to kill people,

04:41.360 --> 04:42.480
I should kill you!

04:49.920 --> 04:51.870
You're just a mortal.

04:52.830 --> 04:54.390
How will you kill me?

04:55.390 --> 04:56.600
Here,

04:57.360 --> 04:59.390
my power is endless.

05:12.310 --> 05:13.000
Look.

05:13.480 --> 05:15.610
You can't hold on much longer, can you?

05:15.920 --> 05:17.160
Mortals

05:17.870 --> 05:19.680
are so weak and powerless.

05:41.750 --> 05:42.720
It's my turn!

05:49.920 --> 05:50.720
Zhuo!

06:06.630 --> 06:07.240
Zhuo!

06:07.390 --> 06:08.250
Zhao Yuanzhou!

06:08.390 --> 06:09.450
Get Jiu out of here!

06:20.480 --> 06:21.360
If this continues,

06:21.360 --> 06:23.560
you won't be able to hold on much longer.

06:26.160 --> 06:26.960
Brother Zhuo!

07:32.680 --> 07:33.540
Zhao Yuanzhou.

08:07.040 --> 08:07.680
Jiu.

08:13.950 --> 08:15.270
Let him go!

08:19.600 --> 08:20.390
Jiu!

08:37.870 --> 08:38.549
Jiu!

08:41.750 --> 08:42.440
Jiu.

08:53.030 --> 08:54.690
Have you ever had a nightmare?

08:56.390 --> 08:57.390
A nightmare is

08:58.840 --> 09:00.360
what you think is over

09:02.630 --> 09:04.720
is actually just the beginning.

09:11.600 --> 09:12.510
Wen Xiao

09:13.390 --> 09:15.630
and Pei Sijing are already dead.

09:17.030 --> 09:18.090
I don't believe it.

09:18.670 --> 09:21.470
Turn around and take a look if you don't believe me.

09:22.360 --> 09:23.360
Impossible.

09:25.200 --> 09:25.960
Impossible.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.270
You're the only one left now.

10:35.950 --> 10:36.810
Are you lonely?

10:38.270 --> 10:39.550
Are you afraid?

10:50.600 --> 10:51.630
Jiu, don't worry.

10:52.360 --> 10:53.420
As long as you need,

10:53.600 --> 10:54.550
I'll come to you.

10:55.360 --> 10:57.490
Then I'll always take the bell with me,

10:58.600 --> 11:00.390
so that you can find me anytime.

11:34.750 --> 11:35.390
No.

11:38.600 --> 11:39.960
This Jiu is fake.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.120
He doesn't have the bell.

11:50.720 --> 11:51.440
So,

11:54.150 --> 11:55.390
this is a dream.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.840
I'm still in the dream.

12:17.790 --> 12:19.050
As long as I kill myself

12:20.960 --> 12:22.270
in the dream,

12:26.150 --> 12:27.630
I can wake up.

12:47.960 --> 12:48.750
Zhuo Yichen!

12:49.150 --> 12:49.960
Wake up!

12:55.720 --> 12:56.450
The smoke...

12:57.150 --> 12:58.390
seems to be poisonous!

12:58.390 --> 12:59.120
Seal!

13:02.870 --> 13:03.600
Zhuo Yichen!

13:03.870 --> 13:04.430
Wake up!

13:05.720 --> 13:06.450
Zhuo Yichen!

13:06.670 --> 13:07.550
Wake up now!

13:08.110 --> 13:09.200
It's useless.

13:09.870 --> 13:12.330
No one can wake up from a Dream of Indulgence.

13:12.840 --> 13:15.570
And it's different from a dream created by Ran Yi.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.910
If he dies in the dream,

13:19.480 --> 13:21.630
he'll die in real life too.

13:25.390 --> 13:25.960
Zhuo!

13:26.360 --> 13:27.090
Zhuo Yichen!

13:34.360 --> 13:36.750
Let me do you a favor.

15:16.270 --> 15:17.440
Are you crazy?

15:18.080 --> 15:21.150
Why did you forcibly suspend your cultivation and bring about your own destruction?

15:21.150 --> 15:23.680
The root of the pagoda tree needs to cultivate

15:23.910 --> 15:26.110
for 100 years to transform into a human.

15:27.870 --> 15:30.000
You forcibly used your demonic power.

15:31.440 --> 15:33.970
You can only stay in the human form for a while.

15:34.870 --> 15:36.120
After a while,

15:39.320 --> 15:41.150
you'll vanish into thin air.

15:51.440 --> 15:52.790
A while

15:53.670 --> 15:55.150
is enough.

16:00.200 --> 16:00.840
I know

16:00.840 --> 16:03.700
you must want to save Zhuo Yichen with the Truth Eye.

16:14.150 --> 16:15.410
So I'm here to help you.

17:08.720 --> 17:09.880
The Truth Eye?

17:11.310 --> 17:12.680
It's indeed amazing.

17:14.880 --> 17:17.480
But it can only stop it for a while.

17:18.750 --> 17:21.440
It can't undo the Dream of Indulgence.

17:25.030 --> 17:26.240
How so?

17:28.960 --> 17:30.760
Because the Dream of Indulgence

17:31.640 --> 17:32.590
is not a spell.

17:33.640 --> 17:34.840
It's a kind of poison.

17:50.990 --> 17:52.590
The Poison Avoidance Pearl?

18:05.270 --> 18:07.590
Mr. Zhuo has been infected with the Poison of Indulgence.

18:07.590 --> 18:08.450
Can you undo it?

18:08.590 --> 18:09.590
I can try.

18:09.750 --> 18:10.750
But I need time.

18:11.750 --> 18:13.200
I'll give you some time.

18:14.240 --> 18:16.640
How about catching up with your old friend?

18:24.270 --> 18:25.070
Qing Geng.

18:26.680 --> 18:28.350
You've been regretting

18:30.080 --> 18:32.080
that you didn't have time to tell Fei

18:34.400 --> 18:36.260
your innermost thoughts, right?

18:40.720 --> 18:41.720
He's not Fei.

18:43.550 --> 18:44.960
Are you sure?

20:15.880 --> 20:17.160
You can't protect her.

20:20.790 --> 20:21.920
Even though I can't,

20:23.350 --> 20:24.310
I must.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.550
Ms. Pei,

20:30.960 --> 20:32.270
can you still stand up?

20:49.720 --> 20:50.510
Ms. Pei.

20:51.550 --> 20:52.480
Give up.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.610
You are no match for me.

21:22.110 --> 21:22.830
Li Lun!

21:23.790 --> 21:25.990
You wanted Zhao Yuanzhou to die so much,

21:26.880 --> 21:28.750
but now you are helping him.

21:31.920 --> 21:32.550
Li Lun.

21:37.350 --> 21:38.210
Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:39.000 --> 21:40.440
As a great demon,

21:40.720 --> 21:43.400
you have the strongest power in the world.

21:43.790 --> 21:45.520
But you lost your demonic power

21:45.550 --> 21:46.800
for a mortal,

21:47.510 --> 21:48.720
covered with wounds.

21:49.830 --> 21:52.400
The two most famous great demons in the Wilderness

21:52.400 --> 21:53.750
are so foolish.

22:09.240 --> 22:10.030
Qing Geng.

22:11.550 --> 22:13.080
You and Fei love each other.

22:14.200 --> 22:16.660
But now you're fighting against each other.

22:18.880 --> 22:20.270
That's why I said

22:21.200 --> 22:22.240
you demons

22:23.880 --> 22:25.590
are so stupid.

22:26.110 --> 22:27.310
You don't understand

22:27.920 --> 22:29.030
because you measure

22:29.030 --> 22:31.200
gains and losses with your eyes.

22:32.270 --> 22:34.330
You've never felt it with your heart.

22:50.550 --> 22:51.720
You are not him.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.790
You're not him.

23:00.480 --> 23:01.590
You're not him!

23:58.790 --> 24:00.270
But how I wish

24:02.070 --> 24:03.680
you were him.

26:10.200 --> 26:11.000
Brother Zhuo!

26:13.480 --> 26:13.880
Brother Zhuo!

26:13.880 --> 26:14.230
Jiu!

26:14.230 --> 26:14.550
Brother Zhuo!

26:14.550 --> 26:14.920
Wake up!

26:14.920 --> 26:15.440
What are you doing here?

26:15.440 --> 26:16.070
Brother Zhuo!

26:16.070 --> 26:16.870
Brother Zhuo.

26:17.070 --> 26:18.030
Brother Zhuo, wake up.

26:18.030 --> 26:18.830
Brother Zhuo.

26:19.030 --> 26:19.830
Brother Zhuo.

26:20.480 --> 26:21.740
Brother Zhuo, wake up!

26:31.830 --> 26:32.630
Brother Zhuo!

26:32.920 --> 26:33.510
Can you hear me?

26:33.510 --> 26:34.310
Brother Zhuo!

26:34.720 --> 26:35.200
Jiu!

26:35.680 --> 26:36.680
Go back to the Demon Hunting Bureau now!

26:36.680 --> 26:37.480
It's too dangerous here!

26:37.480 --> 26:40.270
I stole two Bi Fang's feathers from the Chongwu Camp.

26:40.270 --> 26:41.790
Just like the Shanhai Portal,

26:41.790 --> 26:43.190
it can take you anywhere.

26:43.240 --> 26:46.000
I was worried you and Brother Zhuo wouldn't give up although you're no match for him.

26:46.000 --> 26:47.720
The Bi Fang's feathers are a pair.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.880
The people holding the feathers

26:48.880 --> 26:50.310
can be teleported to each other's location.

26:50.310 --> 26:50.880
Okay.

26:53.510 --> 26:54.310
You take it.

26:54.550 --> 26:56.030
Go back to the Demon Hunting Bureau now.

26:56.030 --> 26:56.830
I promise you.

26:57.070 --> 26:58.160
If we are in danger,

26:58.310 --> 27:00.440
I'll take Zhuo back to you immediately.

27:00.440 --> 27:01.240
Go back to the Demon Hunting Bureau and wait for us.

27:01.240 --> 27:01.880
But Brother Zhuo...

27:01.880 --> 27:02.680
Go back now!

27:31.240 --> 27:32.040
Brother Zhuo.

27:32.270 --> 27:33.070
Brother Zhuo.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.520
You're awake.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.240
Just now in my dream,

27:48.160 --> 27:49.160
I saw a cloud

27:50.350 --> 27:51.440
of cyan light.

27:55.110 --> 27:56.770
It was Qing Geng's inner core.

28:02.960 --> 28:03.760
Fortunately,

28:05.960 --> 28:07.240
I woke you up.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.720
Qing Geng.

28:25.440 --> 28:26.590
I can finally

28:27.720 --> 28:29.880
be with him.

28:33.000 --> 28:34.590
I can be with you forever.

28:45.960 --> 28:46.680
Qing Geng.

29:57.240 --> 29:59.310
Back then, I was blinded

30:00.240 --> 30:02.240
and deceived by you.

30:03.070 --> 30:03.960
Now,

30:04.640 --> 30:06.480
let me see

30:07.160 --> 30:09.590
what on earth you are.

30:29.510 --> 30:31.270
The Truth Eye.

30:46.720 --> 30:49.180
The inner core is at the elbow of his left arm.

30:49.510 --> 30:51.370
You want to destroy my inner core.

30:52.440 --> 30:54.110
Dream on.

30:58.640 --> 30:59.970
The Ever-Burning Wood?

31:02.270 --> 31:03.670
Li Lun, the pagoda ghost,

31:03.920 --> 31:05.240
aren't you afraid?

31:55.920 --> 31:56.720
Brother Zhuo!

32:04.590 --> 32:05.790
We can't protect you.

32:06.030 --> 32:06.750
Jiu,

32:06.960 --> 32:07.510
go now!

32:11.000 --> 32:12.160
Go!

32:21.470 --> 32:22.960
Go!

33:24.030 --> 33:25.520
You're so stubborn.

34:57.000 --> 34:57.840
I'm...

34:58.630 --> 34:59.920
going to kill you.

35:01.150 --> 35:02.360
You actually...

35:19.190 --> 35:20.510
I told you...

35:22.800 --> 35:24.400
I can do it.

35:32.920 --> 35:33.880
Jing.

36:20.630 --> 36:21.490
Don't kill her!

36:21.960 --> 36:22.800
If you want to kill her,

36:22.800 --> 36:23.960
kill me first.

36:25.030 --> 36:25.840
Jiu,

36:28.840 --> 36:29.770
get out of my way.

36:43.150 --> 36:44.440
You're a mortal.

36:45.590 --> 36:47.250
You can't possibly defeat me.

36:47.920 --> 36:48.550
No.

36:50.230 --> 36:51.510
In this illusion,

36:53.760 --> 36:56.000
you are just the fear in my heart.

38:27.710 --> 38:29.170
What else do you want to do?

38:30.440 --> 38:33.040
Don't you think you've done enough bad things?

38:58.320 --> 38:58.920
Done.

39:09.070 --> 39:10.630
I'll give you a candy

39:10.800 --> 39:12.530
every time you treat my wounds.

39:19.880 --> 39:20.880
Although

39:22.590 --> 39:24.000
I love candies,

39:24.760 --> 39:26.550
don't get hurt next time.

39:27.110 --> 39:28.550
Wounds will heal,

39:29.920 --> 39:31.250
but it still hurts a lot.

39:34.400 --> 39:35.360
This time,

39:38.160 --> 39:39.230
you finally...

39:41.000 --> 39:42.670
don't need to save me.

40:17.960 --> 40:18.840
Sister Pei.

40:19.360 --> 40:20.230
Sister Pei.

40:20.840 --> 40:21.830
Wake up.

40:22.800 --> 40:23.800
Maybe

40:24.590 --> 40:25.670
a mortal

40:26.510 --> 40:28.510
can't kill a powerful demon.

40:30.840 --> 40:31.880
But I can

40:33.360 --> 40:35.670
kill my own fear.
